<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλογ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reasoning</i>,
			<i>inference</i>, only 
				Ion.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γνώμης ποιέεσθαι
			ἐπίλογον</span> give a <i>reason</i> for their opinion, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<i>peroration</i> of a speech, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1414b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.202
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				12.5
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>the
				concluding portion of a play</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκθεσις</span>
			,Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1548
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῆς κοσμοποιίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.237
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
			<i>subjoined</i> or <i>explanatory sentence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1394b8
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				a11
			</span></i>.—In <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				719
			</span></i> (lyr.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλογοι</span> is
			corrupt.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
